    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "*Pant* *pant*... so tough. Is everyone okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No problems yet... But... it's really intense. I've never seen combat on this scale before...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm due for a vacation if I make it back from this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Operator"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_012",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. I'll approve it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "But first... let's knock out this team! Then if you want a raise, a vacation, a specific assignment, I'll grant anything!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
