        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Incoming!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't get distracted! Back in formation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "A major firefight by the east exit? Stay calm, push ahead slow. Don't give them an opening!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "These don't look like Ursus or Yan tactics. What's going on? Who are they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "After picking off Ursus soldiers for years, now we get ambushed?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "No actual fighting...? Cowards! You'll pay for underestimating the guerrillas!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Watch the altar! The protection the Captain gave us only mitigates its effects. He told us a million times not to go near it unless we have to!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Runner, get the other teams on the horn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "...No response?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are the mortars? And the devils?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on. Something's not right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
