    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Where are they? What are they waiting for?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "N-No! We can't leave the area! We strike as soon as they show their faces! No one else falls out of contact!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, is that an enemy on top of that building over there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "...A cat? Just one little Feline...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Runner! Tell the casters! The enemy deployed a caster on the building across the way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've gotta take her out!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014A sword? A weapon? She's pulling them out of the air...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Floating weapons?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Slice from here, to there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold it... with my hands. Cut, with the sword.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Like slicing a potato.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like slicing a potato."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "afrom": 0,
        "rfrom": 0,
