    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Doctor! Get over here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "The whole building... got cut in half?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis is destroying the guerrillas' ambush point. Watch for falling debris!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "What the hell was that?",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Assuming you're talking about Rosmontis's Arts, it may be time to explain it to you, now that you've seen it so many times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is a state of mind she shapes herself. You can think of it like Rosmontis has a gigantic, second, invisible body that cannot be acted upon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "It is a formless extension of her sense of touch. She can grab, squeeze, lift up, and toss away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "But these Arts lack objective manifestation, as opposed to her subjective mind.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "It can act upon us with force, but we cannot act upon it. We only know it exists with the application of special Originium Arts.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "You need not grasp it fully. This is not your area of expertise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rosmontis was much more destructive before we put a weapon in her hands. A lot like being crushed beneath the treads of a nomadic city. All that's left is a crying young girl alone in the ruins.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Under no circumstances can that be allowed to happen again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Doctor, move.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see it. The command group is coming...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "There should be a waterway under the ruins of the park fountain.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "They hid in such an inconspicuous place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "...The story of the ambush on Graymane Peak, that supposedly involved seven straight days of stakeout and tricked the strongest of knights, may well have been true.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go, Dr. {@nickname}. No time to lose.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Raidian, cease fire. Find a good place to hide. I need you to focus on keeping our comms up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mantra-2, log all our conversations. Every last word.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Runner Group Fourteen, successfully intercepted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, Dr. Kal'tsit, I'm ready.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Are you okay...? Talk to me! Look at me!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(Good, you're with us. I'm okay. Doesn't matter. You hide somewhere, don't let them find you... we need you to regroup.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(I know. We'll get them. You stay quiet!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "(I'm fine. No injuries. A little stone is nothing compared to an Ursus Fortcracker.)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Don't panic! I can stop it, you look for an opening!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "You! What are you looking at?! Too scared to fight us?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whoever you are, you lost the guts to take us on now? Too scared of Patriot's blood? Scared of his witchcraft?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Thinking back to the time you fought the Sarkaz? You had them outnumbered, you could've won, but in the end you just ran up the casualties!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "But we'll do you one better! You can't break our shields, you can't crack our armor! You're nothing before the undying Patriot!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "The mightiest Ursus warrior... needs no spear or shield. He'll stomp you to pieces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... are nothing!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our fighters will regroup here soon! You can't run. Reunion will put you through hell!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oppressors who enslave the Infected like us! You will be swallowed up by the Reunion movement!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Reunion already betrayed you, sir.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Little girl?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Two... Infected little girls?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you doing?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Out of the way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's a man behind you, and I'm going to break the device behind him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "You think I'll show you mercy just because you look like a kid?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't underestimate Patriot's Guard! We're the Aegis of the Infected... I'm here to stop your attack.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you attack the Infected, I'll strangle you with my own two hands!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then my weapons will talk for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042",
        "name2": "avg_npc_058",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You... You're the cat from before.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your sword...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_transmissionget",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "(Get out of here, guardian! Tell the others! I'll be okay!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Runner"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_058"
    },
    {
        "text": "(That's your job, not mine! You have to survive!)",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Come, try to pierce my shield! Try to break my armor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Guerrilla Fighter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya. I'm out of options.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_042"
    },
    {
        "text": "He won't die. But he may never walk again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Wait\u2014",
        "values": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Go. Stab...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis"
    },
